<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 60 tonnes of spot tin.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 60 tonnes of spot tin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it sold 60 tonnes of spot tin for $334,195.</p>
<p>Allied Deals bought 40 tonnes at $2.5267 per lb, and Ney Smelting &amp; Refining bought 20 tonnes at $2.5261 a lb.</p>
<p>The next spot offer of tin will be July 2.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
